{
  "id": "2742",
  "title": "Mom Is Not a Horse",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2025-07-27",
  "synopsis": "Why does the Chinese character for \"mom\" include a horse? And what character do you get when you put a woman and a child together?\n(The explanations in this lesson are based on simplified characters but are also applicable to traditional characters.)",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/2742/2acbf70e65c17044283622c2ac19c661605f6767.mp3?1752838746",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "妈妈不是马\n\n    你认识“女”这个字吗？“女”是女生、女人。妈妈、姐姐、妹妹、奶奶……她们都是女人，这些词里都有“女”字。\n    你看，“妈妈”的“妈”，左边是“女”字，右边是“马”字。\n    为什么有“女”？因为“妈”是一个女人。那右边的“马”呢？不是说妈妈是马。那是因为“马”的读音和“妈妈”的“ma”很像。\n    还有“好”这个字，左边是“女”字，右边是“子”字。“女”是女人，“子”是孩子。妈妈和孩子在一起，就是“好”。\n    你觉得这些汉字有意思吗？",
    "traditional": "媽媽不是馬\n\n    你認識“女”這個字嗎？“女”是女生、女人。媽媽、姐姐、妹妹、奶奶……她們都是女人，這些詞裡都有“女”字。\n    你看，“媽媽”的“媽”，左邊是“女”字，右邊是“馬”字。\n    為什麼有“女”？因為“媽”是一個女人。那右邊的“馬”呢？不是說媽媽是馬。那是因為“馬”的讀音和“媽媽”的“ma”很像。\n    還有“好”這個字，左邊是“女”字，右邊是“子”字。“女”是女人，“子”是孩子。媽媽和孩子在一起，就是“好”。\n    你覺得這些漢字有意思嗎？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom Is Not A Horse"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "你认识“女”这个字吗？“女”是女生、女人。",
      "traditional": "你認識“女”這個字嗎？“女”是女生、女人。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ rèn shi nǚ zhè ge zì ma nǚ shì nǚ shēng nǚ rén",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "妈妈、姐姐、妹妹、奶奶……她们都是女人，这些词里都有“女”字。",
      "traditional": "媽媽、姐姐、妹妹、奶奶……她們都是女人，這些詞裡都有“女”字。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma jiě jie mèi mei nǎi nai tā men dōu shì nǚ rén zhè xiē cí lǐ dōu yǒu nǚ zì",
      "english": "Do you know the character “女”? “女” means girl or woman."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom, elder sister, younger sister, grandmother … they are all women, and these words all contain the character “女”."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "你看，“妈妈”的“妈”，左边是“女”字，右边是“马”字。",
      "traditional": "你看，“媽媽”的“媽”，左邊是“女”字，右邊是“馬”字。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kàn mā ma de mā zuǒ bian shì nǚ zì yòu bian shì mǎ zì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You see, the “妈” in “妈妈” [mother] has the character “女” [woman] on the left and the character “马” [horse] on the right."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "为什么有“女”？因为“妈”是一个女人。那右边的“马”呢？",
      "traditional": "為什麼有“女”？因為“媽”是一個女人。那右邊的“馬”呢？",
      "pinyin": "wèi shén me yǒu nǚ yīn wèi mā shì yí ge nǚ rén nà yòu bian de mǎ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "不是说妈妈是马。",
      "traditional": "不是說媽媽是馬。",
      "pinyin": "bú shì shuō mā ma shì mǎ",
      "english": "Why is there a “woman”? Because “mom” is a woman. Then what about the “horse” on the right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "那是因为“马”的读音和“妈妈”的“ma”很像。",
      "traditional": "那是因為“馬”的讀音和“媽媽”的“ma”很像。",
      "pinyin": "nà shì yīn wèi mǎ de dú yīn hé mā ma de 1 hěn xiàng",
      "english": "It’s not saying that mom is a horse."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It’s because the pronunciation of “马” [horse] is very similar to the “ma” in “妈妈” [mother]."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "还有“好”这个字，左边是“女”字，右边是“子”字。",
      "traditional": "還有“好”這個字，左邊是“女”字，右邊是“子”字。",
      "pinyin": "hái yǒu hǎo zhè ge zì zuǒ bian shì nǚ zì yòu bian shì zǐ zì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "“女”是女人，“子”是孩子。妈妈和孩子在一起，就是“好”。",
      "traditional": "“女”是女人，“子”是孩子。媽媽和孩子在一起，就是“好”。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ shì nǚ rén zǐ shì hái zi mā ma hé hái zi zài yì qǐ jiù shì hǎo",
      "english": "There is also the character “好”, with “女” on the left and “子” on the right."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“女” means woman, and “子” means child. A mother and child together is “good”."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "你觉得这些汉字有意思吗？",
      "traditional": "你覺得這些漢字有意思嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ jué de zhè xiē hàn zì yǒu yì si ma",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
