    "sentence_translations": [
      "Mom Is Not A Horse",
      "",
      "Do you know the character “女”? “女” means girl or woman.",
      "Mom, elder sister, younger sister, grandmother … they are all women, and these words all contain the character “女”.",
      "",
      "You see, the “妈” in “妈妈” [mother] has the character “女” [woman] on the left and the character “马” [horse] on the right.",
      "",
      "Why is there a “woman”? Because “mom” is a woman. Then what about the “horse” on the right?",
      "It’s not saying that mom is a horse.",
      "It’s because the pronunciation of “马” [horse] is very similar to the “ma” in “妈妈” [mother].",
      "",
      "There is also the character “好”, with “女” on the left and “子” on the right.",
      "“女” means woman, and “子” means child. A mother and child together is “good”.",
      "",
      "Do you find these Chinese characters interesting?"
